<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06008003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s). 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Proceed repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install fender apron extension.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct plug weld or resistance spot weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten bolt to specified torque. (vehicle left side only)
</ptxt>
